pattern A; x = (1.74205, 0.00000); plant = move
  |x - e(30)|^2 - 1 = +0.01742,  |x - e(-30)|^2 - 1 = +0.01742
  colour 0: STRADDLED by S0   [S0: min<1 True, max>1 True]
  colour 1: not straddled   [Q5: min<1 False, max>1 True]
  colour 2: STRADDLED by Q0   [Q0: min<1 True, max>1 True]
  colour 3: STRADDLED by G5   [Q1: min<1 False, max>1 True; G5: min<1 True, max>1 True]
  colour 4: STRADDLED by G0   [G0: min<1 True, max>1 True]
  colour 5: STRADDLED by S5   [S5: min<1 True, max>1 True]
=> unstraddled colours at x: [1]
